{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ce11520546392760","name":"Fight Defensively","source":{"id":"source:reference-ce11520546392760","title":"Fight Defensively","revision":18172,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:42:41Z","sha256":"f61d53b8978d9d8ff565f2be959bf25d7ba9e32fc50f10f82e197d08466ac33b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18172","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Fight%20Defensively&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ce11520546392760","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can concentrate more on protecting yourself than hurting your enemies. You can take a -5 penalty on your attack rolls and gain a +2 dodge bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of your next turn. If you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," skill, you instead gain a +5 dodge bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," when you Fight Defensively, or a +10 dodge bonus if you choose to make no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks","referenceId":"reference:1e3a955bd202b306"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," can order their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to Fight Defensively as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", hunkering down to resist an incoming attack. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can make no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks","referenceId":"reference:1e3a955bd202b306"}," until the beginning of the Attack Leader's next turn, but gains a +5 bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Total Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you choose to make no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks","referenceId":"reference:1e3a955bd202b306"}," until your next turn (not even ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},"), you gain a +5 dodge bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Fly Defensively"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," can concentrate more on protecting their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", than hurting their enemies. You and all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," on your Vehicle take a -5 penalty on your attack rolls, and your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," gains a +2 dodge bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of your next turn. If you choose to make no attacks, your Vehicle instead gains a +5 dodge bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", and all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," take a -10 penalty on their attack rolls until the start of your next turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trained Pilot:"]}," If you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," skill, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," instead gains a +5 dodge bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", with you and all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," on your Vehicle taking a -5 penalty on attack rolls; or a +10 dodge bonus if you choose to make no attacks on your turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
